# Keep the build context small and free of secrets. The image needs the workspace manifests, the
# lockfile, apps/web and packages/*; apps/mobile contributes only its package.json.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.expo
.git
.github
.claude
.kilo
doc
aws/*
!aws/migrations
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
*.docx
apps/mobile/*
!apps/mobile/package.json
apps/web/__tests__
apps/web/testSupport
apps/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
docker/latex/*.token
